 "library": {
  "title": "PS5 DualSense-style game controller, 160 x 106 mm",
  "description": "Detailed PlayStation 5 DualSense-style gamepad, about 160 wide, 106 deep, 40 high, lying flat with the shoulders towards +Y. Smooth two-tone body: a black core (smooth blend of a centre ellipsoid and two grip capsules) under two white wings (one blend each) covering the grips and outer top. Black touchpad with blue light bars on both sides, speaker grille, PS button with logo, mute key with its orange light, angled Create and Options keys, two analogue sticks (well, post, cap, concave dish, rim), a D-pad of four arrow keys in a round well, four domed face buttons in a well with grey triangle / circle / cross / square marks, L1/R1 bumpers, curved L2/R2 triggers and a USB-C port. Blend detail (90 core, 80 wings) sets smoothness vs triangles (~195k). Modelled from published sizes, not Sony's files.",
  "tags": [
   "PlayStation",
   "PS5",
   "DualSense",
   "gamepad",
   "joystick",
   "manette",
   "controller"
  ],
